Z||000000||Cooter||06-09-2000||08:35 PM||||I got a chance today to see how the new engine/tranny combo would perform an acceleration test:<BR>Best 0 to 60 was a traction limited 7.2 seconds. I cant get off the line without smoking the tires and at full throttle in second gear it starts breaking traction above 4500 RPM's. I have no idea if that is a good time or not, so some of you Car and Driver subscribers tell me what that compares to.<P>Thanks,<BR>Greg||||reg||1
